### What changed vs. the previous attempt

| Problem | Fix |
|---|---|
| `for (Contact c : Trigger.new)` – compiler sees `List<SObject>` | Cast once: `List<Contact> newContacts = (List<Contact>) Trigger.new;` and loop over `newContacts` |
| `update accountsToUpdate;` where `accountsToUpdate` was `Set<Account>` – not a valid DML collection | Changed to `List<Account> accountsToUpdate`; the in-order mutation logic guarantees each Account is added at most once |
| Trigger couldn't find `ContactTriggerHandler` | Resolved automatically once the class compiles |

